          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An arabkop, yam abedo abaka me Icrael i Jerucalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abedo miyo wia tic kede ryeko me yenyo kede ŋeyo jami luŋ ame tye ka timere i te polo piny kano Obaŋa omio dano lolle i tic ame mom kelo yomcuny kadi acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyeko neno jami luŋ ame tye atimere piny i te ceŋ piny kan; gin luŋ aluŋa anwoŋo ni konygi pe; gin luŋ rom aroma i ryemo yo yamo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
